hings the answer to all of  these issues is not don't listen to  music  it is a huge part of everyday life and  brings joy for hundreds of millions of  people around the world if you  had no music industry  the world would be a terrible place but  the issue of sustainability in the music  industry speaks to something bigger how  we balance enjoying our lives with being  as sustainable as possible and how we  have a personal responsibility to do  something  even if it seems like it's just  something small  a lot of people wonder should i listen  to music less should i listen in  moderation should i not listen at all  don't not listen at all  the problems that the music industry is  facing in terms of its environmental  impact are industrial choices they are  changeable music is is one of the good  ways to be  living in the world  having said that we need to make this  transition  of decarbonization  urgently quickly just like any other  industry or any other  culture or sector of human activity on  the planet and that's the bottom line  you
 

